From: ssch71 <s01093450498@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:20:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] SemAsyncVideoFrameDecoder: Force the SW codec on SM8250

The ported frame extractor converts the Venus UBWC output of the HW HEVC
decoder with an SM8550 converter, which produces broken frames on SM8250.
Best Face found no faces in the motion photo frames because of this.
Always request the SW codec.

---
 .../com/samsung/android/media/SemAsyncVideoFrameDecoder.smali | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali_classes6/com/samsung/android/media/SemAsyncVideoFrameDecoder.smali b/smali_classes6/com/samsung/android/media/SemAsyncVideoFrameDecoder.smali
--- a/smali_classes6/com/samsung/android/media/SemAsyncVideoFrameDecoder.smali
+++ b/smali_classes6/com/samsung/android/media/SemAsyncVideoFrameDecoder.smali
@@ -870,6 +870,8 @@
 
     :cond_1
     :goto_0
+    const/4 p1, 0x2
+
     invoke-direct {p0, p1}, Lcom/samsung/android/media/SemAsyncVideoFrameDecoder;->_setPreferredCodec(I)V
 
     return-void
